ONNX Runtime outage switch.

While this file exists, CI skips the steps that execute ONNX Runtime:

- wpt-conformance.yml: the ONNX job reports a warning and skips its conformance run.
- wpt-sync.yml: the ONNX expected-failure sync is skipped.

onnxruntime-availability.yml probes the ONNX Runtime download once a day and opens a pull
request that deletes this file as soon as `make onnxruntime-download` works again. Deleting
the file is all it takes to re-enable the steps; adding it back disables them again.

Added on 2026-11-19: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime and its release archives
return 404, so `make onnxruntime-download` cannot fetch the library.
